  m_Name: Family Recipe
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Family Recipe
  content: 'Hellen''s Spring Vegetable Stew


    2 carrots

    1 onion

    A handful
    of spring greens

    Fresh herbs from the garden

    Salt and pepper to taste


    Simmer
    until the vegetables soften. Elian insists on adding twice the pepper.

    Don''t
    let him.


    If Lily is helping, let her stir the pot. She says food tastes
    better when everyone helps make it.'
